id: invigorating-performance
name: Invigorating Performance
order: 5
optionOf: show-stopping-performance
optionEffect: 1
description: >
  When using the Hype Maneuver, regain 5(bT) Life and Ki Points.
text: >
  Invigorating Performance [Triggered, 1/Round]: When using the Hype Maneuver, regain 5(bT) Life and Ki Points.

---

# The Hype Maneuver used (use-maneuver.mjs, the `hype` Moment): Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button. What
# it gives back said on the Hype's card.
[triggered/hype, 1/round, effect 1]
life.value += 5(bT);
ki.value += 5(bT);
